v 3
d 'DECIDER': Structured probabilistic decisions over text variables in Stata
d
d Applies structured decision models (choice, ordered score, or binary noul
d probability) to one or more string variables in memory. Supports local
d Apple Silicon NeoJev (MLX) and hosted OpenRouter Decisions API with
d explicit cloud opt-in, prompt hashing, option-order stability checks,
d crash-safe row-ID checkpointing/resume, frame-based merging, and r()
d returned results.
d
d Requires: Stata 16+, Python 3.10+ (stdlib only for OpenRouter; MLX for local NeoJev)
d Distribution-Date: 20261125
d Author: Marshall Garland
d
f decider.ado
f decider.sthlp
f _decider_score.py
